# Code owners for sc_linac_physics.
#
# GitHub requests review automatically from the owners listed here. The point is
# coverage, not gatekeeping: every area should have someone besides its author
# who can competently read changes to it.
#
# Two kinds of reviewer are listed:
#
#   @s-aderhold  — software design: framework structure, phase sequencing,
#                  architecture, threading, persistence.
#
#   @RDPorter    — machine behavior: as area physicist he needs to know exactly
#                  what this code commands the hardware to do and how it derives
#                  the numbers people act on. He is listed on everything that
#                  writes to a PV or analyzes measurement data, regardless of
#                  which application it lives in.
#
# Engineers still learning an area are deliberately NOT listed here. CODEOWNERS
# makes review a gate, and a gate someone cannot yet act on either blocks the PR
# or produces approvals that mean nothing. Add them as additional reviewers on
# individual PRs instead — see "Learning reviewer" in the PR template.

# Default
*                                                       @lisazacarias

